$\mathrm{e}=\frac{\text { Velocity after collision }}{\text { Velocity before collision }}\begin{array}{ll}
1 & 1=\frac{\left(v_2-\frac{2 v_1}{3}\right)}{v_1} \ldots(e=1, \text { for elastic collision }) \\
